1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,280
There is a legend that says,

2
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:06,620
the face you have now once belonged to the person you loved most in a past life.

3
00:00:07,300 --> 00:00:11,340
Every time you look at yourself, you're looking at your old love.

4
00:00:12,340 --> 00:00:15,080
Maybe that's why some eyes feel strangely familiar.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,520
Love never truly leaves.

6
00:00:18,240 --> 00:00:19,720
It simply changes its face.
